_Sky%2C_Dhaka%2C_Bangladesh.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Clear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg/500px-Clear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Clear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg/1280px-Clear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Clear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg/500px-Clear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Clear skies over Yekaterinburg, Russia","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AClear_skies_over_Yekaterinburg.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Rayleigh_sunlight_scattering.png/500px-Rayleigh_sunlight_scattering.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Rayleigh_sunlight_scattering.png/500px-Rayleigh_sunlight_scattering.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Earth's atmosphere scatters a greater proportion of blue light than of red light.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARayleigh_sunlight_scattering.png"}],"sounds":{"hazy":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vininn126-hazy.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vininn126-hazy.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vininn126-hazy.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vininn126-hazy.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vininn126-hazy.wav.ogg"}],"sky":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vo